Với hàm countExcellentStudents:
flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> N1{List is null}
    N1 -- Yes --> R[Return 0]
    N1 -- No --> N2{List is empty}

    N2 -- Yes --> R
    N2 -- No --> L[For each score]

    L --> C1{Score is null}
    C1 -- Yes --> L

    C1 -- No --> C2{Score is NaN or Infinite}
    C2 -- Yes --> L

    C2 -- No --> C3{Score in range 0 to 10}
    C3 -- No --> L

    C3 -- Yes --> C4{Score >= 8}
    C4 -- Yes --> A[Increase count]
    C4 -- No --> L

    A --> L
    L --> E([End loop])
    E --> RET[Return count]

Voi Ham calculateValidAverage:
flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> N1{List is null}
    N1 -- Yes --> R0[Return 0]

    N1 -- No --> N2{List is empty}
    N2 -- Yes --> R0
    N2 -- No --> L[For each score]

    L --> C1{Score is null}
    C1 -- Yes --> L

    C1 -- No --> C2{Score is NaN or Infinite}
    C2 -- Yes --> L

    C2 -- No --> C3{Score in range 0 to 10}
    C3 -- No --> L

    C3 -- Yes --> A[Add score and increase valid count]
    A --> L

    L --> END([End loop])
    END --> D{Valid count is zero}
    D -- Yes --> R0
    D -- No --> R1[Return average]
